WEBVTT

00:01.017 --> 00:02.737
<b>This is our Clinic.</b>

00:02.737 --> 00:04.317
<b>Where diseases are cured!</b>

00:04.807 --> 00:06.057
<b>Correct!</b>

00:06.057 --> 00:07.637
<b>The Building Cost is low too,</b>

00:07.637 --> 00:09.057
<b>so I had it built.</b>

00:09.057 --> 00:11.317
<b>My king, are you sick?</b>

00:11.317 --> 00:12.577
<b>I'm not.</b>

00:12.577 --> 00:14.957
<b>We're here because your guard is here.</b>

00:16.007 --> 00:18.417
<b>You don't mean <i>them</i>, do you?</b>

00:18.737 --> 00:20.547
<b>Yeah, <i>them</i>!</b>

00:24.667 --> 00:25.777
<b>Are you in?</b>

00:34.307 --> 00:38.167
<b>Oh! It's our great and mighty 
king, King Ira Takuto!</b>

00:38.167 --> 00:40.947
<b>We're honored to have you visit us here!</b>

00:40.947 --> 00:43.317
<b>What an auspicious day!</b>

00:43.987 --> 00:47.357
<b>Please, command us as you wish!</b>

02:24.547 --> 02:26.007
What a Human Thing to Do!

02:29.467 --> 02:31.827
<b>Their enthusiasm is sufficient.</b>

02:31.827 --> 02:35.067
<b>They pass as subordinates of King Takuto.</b>

02:35.067 --> 02:38.817
<b>Yeah, I produced them to 
prepare for the worst,</b>

02:38.817 --> 02:41.847
<b>but I've just had them standing by until now.</b>

02:41.847 --> 02:44.007
<b>I figure they'd be perfect for the task.</b>

02:44.007 --> 02:45.167
<b>That's true.</b>

02:45.167 --> 02:48.187
<b>Given their abilities, 
they'll be adequate guards.</b>

02:48.187 --> 02:51.627
<b>I never thought we'd be 
using them so soon though.</b>

02:51.627 --> 02:52.767
<b>Um...</b>

02:53.857 --> 02:56.957
<b>My king, who are these people?</b>

02:56.957 --> 02:58.647
<b>They're Medics.</b>

02:58.647 --> 03:00.857
<b>They not just treat injuries and diseases,</b>

03:00.857 --> 03:03.827
<b>but they can also fight to protect you.</b>

03:04.257 --> 03:05.977
<b>Medics!</b>

03:08.337 --> 03:13.177
<b>Our great king, King Ira Takuto, 
has words for all of you.</b>

03:13.177 --> 03:14.927
<b>Pay close attention!</b>

03:14.927 --> 03:16.507
<b>Yes, ma'am!</b>

03:17.017 --> 03:20.057
<b>You are to protect these two 
as they head to Dragontan,</b>

03:20.537 --> 03:23.557
<b>and observe the culture and the 
current state of that land!</b>

03:23.557 --> 03:25.877
<b>O-Oh!</b>

03:25.877 --> 03:26.957
<b>Culture!</b>

03:26.957 --> 03:27.917
<b>Observation!</b>

03:27.917 --> 03:28.807
<b>Protecting!</b>

03:28.807 --> 03:31.147
<b>What a human thing to do!</b>

03:33.657 --> 03:36.897
<b>We graciously accept this 
most honorable mission!</b>

03:36.897 --> 03:39.147
<b>We shall all behave as humans!</b>

03:39.147 --> 03:42.167
<b>And complete this mission perfectly!</b>

03:42.167 --> 03:44.917
<b>After all, we are exemplary, model humans!</b>

03:44.917 --> 03:47.377
<b>So carrying out tasks in a human manner...</b>

03:48.077 --> 03:50.337
<b>is our forte!</b>

03:50.337 --> 03:52.487
<b>Forte!</b>

03:53.577 --> 03:55.907
<b><i>They're quite enthusiastic.</i></b>

03:55.907 --> 03:57.357
<b><i>This is a good opportunity too,</i></b>

03:57.357 --> 04:00.637
<b><i>so maybe I should do something king-like?</i></b>

04:01.967 --> 04:02.777
<b>You three.</b>

04:02.777 --> 04:03.497
<b>Yes!</b>

04:03.497 --> 04:06.267
<b>Please give us your commands, my king!</b>

04:06.647 --> 04:09.727
<b>It's a little early, but 
I'll grant you a reward for</b>

04:09.727 --> 04:12.807
<b>protecting these two and 
following their orders.</b>

04:12.807 --> 04:13.947
<b>A reward?!</b>

04:14.227 --> 04:16.787
<b>Yeah. I'll grant you names.</b>

04:16.787 --> 04:19.067
<b>Human names.</b>

04:19.067 --> 04:22.157
<b>You would give us human names?!</b>

04:22.497 --> 04:25.607
<b>Ichiro. Jiro. Saburo.</b>

04:25.607 --> 04:27.997
<b>You may go by those names from now on.</b>

04:29.737 --> 04:30.867
<b>Oh!</b>

04:31.317 --> 04:33.007
<b>Oh!</b>

04:33.007 --> 04:37.377
<b><i>In this world, units have 
individuality, unlike in the game.</i></b>

04:37.377 --> 04:39.407
<b><i>They're obsessed with humans too.</i></b>

04:39.407 --> 04:42.467
<b><i>So acknowledging that 
individuality will likely...</i></b>

04:42.467 --> 04:44.247
<b>Ichiro!</b>

04:44.247 --> 04:48.977
<b>Let us honor this blessing of names 
by completing our mission perfectly!</b>

04:48.977 --> 04:50.337
<b>Indeed, Jiro!</b>

04:50.337 --> 04:52.897
<b>That would truly be a human thing to do!</b>

04:52.897 --> 04:56.257
<b>Do not forget about me, Saburo!</b>

04:56.257 --> 04:57.737
<b>Or me either!</b>

04:59.257 --> 05:01.117
<b>Did I go too far?</b>

05:01.117 --> 05:03.347
<b>Perhaps.</b>

05:03.347 --> 05:05.547
<b>W-What do you think, Caria?</b>

05:06.267 --> 05:07.667
<b>Are you okay?</b>

05:08.167 --> 05:09.817
<b>Y-Yes.</b>

05:09.817 --> 05:13.287
<b>Um, we'll do our best.</b>

05:13.287 --> 05:15.327
<b>If you're ever in trouble,</b>

05:15.327 --> 05:17.337
<b>please feel free to ask me anything.</b>

05:17.337 --> 05:20.757
<b>T-Thank you, Atou.</b>

05:21.687 --> 05:22.957
<b>Human!</b>

05:21.687 --> 05:22.957
<b>Human!</b>

05:22.957 --> 05:25.227
<b>Human! Human!</b>

05:32.807 --> 05:35.577
<b>I'm done with this!</b>

05:38.067 --> 05:41.907
<b>There's too much work to be done as mayor!</b>

05:41.907 --> 05:44.947
<b>And here I thought I finally 
managed to snag a life of freedom</b>

05:44.947 --> 05:47.447
<b>from that stiff, prim 
and proper elven nation!</b>

05:47.447 --> 05:49.327
<b>I thought I'd fall in love with a handsome man</b>

05:49.327 --> 05:52.947
<b>and live happily ever after with him 
while building a happy family!</b>

05:52.947 --> 05:55.047
<b>This whole world can perish!</b>

05:55.047 --> 05:56.867
<b>Right now! With all of its couples!</b>

06:03.327 --> 06:07.307
<b>What do you mean, I'm supposed to work with
the forces of darkness to protect the city?!</b>

06:07.307 --> 06:09.727
<b>I've never even heard of this Mynoghra!</b>

06:10.547 --> 06:13.147
<b>Excuse me, Mayor Antik.</b>

06:13.147 --> 06:13.817
<b>What?!</b>

06:15.197 --> 06:15.867
<b>Oh.</b>

06:21.977 --> 06:23.617
<b>What did you need?</b>

06:23.617 --> 06:25.537
<b>Oh, well...</b>

06:25.537 --> 06:28.977
<b>There are some people who 
wish to meet you, Mayor.</b>

06:28.977 --> 06:31.207
<b>Huh? Visitors?</b>

06:31.667 --> 06:33.217
<b>Do they have an appointment?</b>

06:33.217 --> 06:34.717
<b>They do not.</b>

06:34.717 --> 06:35.727
<b>That so?</b>

06:35.727 --> 06:37.437
<b>Then send them away.</b>

06:37.437 --> 06:40.387
<b>My time is more precious than gold.</b>

06:40.387 --> 06:42.967
<b>Anyone who interrupts me should die!</b>

06:42.967 --> 06:44.887
<b>H-However, Mayor...</b>

06:45.757 --> 06:47.157
<b>What?!</b>

06:47.157 --> 06:49.937
<b>They say they're emissaries from Mynoghra.</b>

06:50.977 --> 06:53.297
<b>Start with that!</b>

06:53.297 --> 06:56.437
<b>That makes this the highest priority!</b>

07:00.297 --> 07:02.247
<b>Welcome to Dragontan.</b>

07:02.247 --> 07:06.617
<b>I'm Antelise Antik, and I serve as its mayor.</b>

07:09.827 --> 07:12.697
<b><i>Wh-What's with this aura?</i></b>

07:12.697 --> 07:16.327
<b><i>Why did the Staff Holders join 
forces with these things?</i></b>

07:16.327 --> 07:17.917
<b><i>Are they idiots?</i></b>

07:20.817 --> 07:24.597
<b>I'm grateful that you traveled 
all this way to visit.</b>

07:24.997 --> 07:28.547
<b>I'm Caria Elfuur of Mynoghra.</b>

07:28.547 --> 07:32.017
<b>This is my big sis, Maria Elfuur.</b>

07:32.017 --> 07:33.557
<b>I'm her big sis!</b>

07:33.557 --> 07:36.757
<b>Well, well, how polite of you.</b>

07:37.787 --> 07:39.227
<b><i>Dark Elves...</i></b>

07:39.647 --> 07:44.817
<b><i>I had been told that Mynoghra had 
welcomed them in as citizens,</i></b>

07:44.817 --> 07:47.697
<b><i>but I wonder what kind of 
people these girls are?</i></b>

07:48.737 --> 07:51.357
<b><i>The three behind them warrant caution.</i></b>

07:51.357 --> 07:55.537
<b><i>Long ago, I heard about 
Dark Elf assassins...</i></b>

07:56.567 --> 07:57.667
<b>Um?</b>

07:57.967 --> 08:00.917
<b>Oh, I'm sorry for staring!</b>

08:00.917 --> 08:04.297
<b>I wish I could have welcomed you properly, 
but your visit was so sudden...</b>

08:04.297 --> 08:06.197
<b>No, that's fine.</b>

08:06.197 --> 08:07.137
<b>Yeah, yeah.</b>

08:07.447 --> 08:09.887
<b>I appreciate that.</b>

08:10.427 --> 08:14.217
<b><i>What are these children doing as emissaries?</i></b>

08:14.217 --> 08:16.707
<b><i>It feels like there's something 
more to these sisters...</i></b>

08:17.417 --> 08:19.427
<b><i>Hmm? Elfuur?</i></b>

08:20.317 --> 08:22.987
<b><i>Didn't Lady Tonukapoli mention something?</i></b>

08:22.987 --> 08:25.297
<b>There was a pair of sisters named Elfuur</b>

08:25.297 --> 08:29.327
<b>who the king is personally educating 
to become that nation's future leaders.</b>

08:29.327 --> 08:30.907
<b>Geh?!</b>

08:31.177 --> 08:33.457
<b>W-What's the matter?!</b>

08:33.457 --> 08:34.577
<b>Croak?</b>

08:34.877 --> 08:37.577
<b><i>These two are incredibly major figures!</i></b>

08:37.577 --> 08:40.287
<b><i>What are these children doing here?!</i></b>

08:40.287 --> 08:44.587
<b><i>If I mishandle them at all, 
it could become a major issue!</i></b>

08:45.347 --> 08:49.757
<b>Wh-What b-b-business brings you to our city?</b>

08:49.757 --> 08:53.107
<b>Uh! Well?!</b>

08:53.627 --> 08:56.477
<b>My lady, may I?</b>

08:56.477 --> 08:57.917
<b>Oh, yes.</b>

08:57.917 --> 08:59.937
<b>What is it, Jiro?</b>

09:00.487 --> 09:02.147
<b>Mayor Antik.</b>

09:02.147 --> 09:03.067
<b>Yes?!</b>

09:03.607 --> 09:05.937
<b>Our current visit</b>

09:05.937 --> 09:12.347
<b>is in response to the invitation from Master
Pepe, the Staff Holder, to come and play.</b>

09:12.347 --> 09:16.417
<b>We are essentially students visiting to 
learn about life in another nation.</b>

09:16.417 --> 09:19.587
<b>O-Oh? That's what this is?</b>

09:19.587 --> 09:24.437
<b>One could say this is but the first step 
to ensure a smooth exchange in the future,</b>

09:24.437 --> 09:27.547
<b>so please understand that this 
is merely a greeting.</b>

09:27.547 --> 09:28.817
<b>A greeting?</b>

09:28.817 --> 09:29.607
<b>Yes.</b>

09:29.607 --> 09:32.997
<b>These young ladies are 
still young and learning.</b>

09:32.997 --> 09:36.017
<b>We would appreciate it if we 
could avoid official talks.</b>

09:37.667 --> 09:39.527
<b>Is that so?</b>

09:39.527 --> 09:43.477
<b>So you're not visiting to 
negotiate any agreements, then!</b>

09:43.477 --> 09:44.657
<b>We are not.</b>

09:44.657 --> 09:48.757
<b>If you would, kindly consider 
us simple tourists...</b>

09:48.757 --> 09:50.777
<b>Isn't that right, young ladies?</b>

09:50.777 --> 09:52.577
<b>That's right! That's right!</b>

09:52.577 --> 09:53.787
<b>Yeah, yeah!</b>

09:53.787 --> 09:55.647
<b><i>Thank goodness!</i></b>

09:55.647 --> 09:57.707
<b><i>It's just a meet and greet!</i></b>

09:57.707 --> 10:02.247
<b><i>Though I'll need to be careful 
not to offend these girls.</i></b>

10:02.247 --> 10:06.167
<b>In that case, please feel free to 
take in the sights of our city!</b>

10:06.167 --> 10:08.427
<b>If you'd like, I could show you around.</b>

10:08.427 --> 10:09.137
<b>Really?!</b>

10:09.137 --> 10:11.597
<b>You'd show us around, Mayor?!</b>

10:11.597 --> 10:12.597
<b>Yes!</b>

10:12.597 --> 10:16.557
<b>I'm very familiar with every 
corner of this city, after all.</b>

10:18.857 --> 10:20.837
<b><i>I need to get along with these girls</i></b>

10:20.837 --> 10:23.737
<b><i>and ensure they leave with a good impression!</i></b>

10:23.737 --> 10:26.687
<b><i>It's crucial for future 
negotiations to go well!</i></b>

10:26.687 --> 10:28.917
<b>Shall we get going, then?</b>

10:28.917 --> 10:31.387
<b><i>Yes! I get to ditch work!</i></b>

10:35.737 --> 10:37.927
<b>We have many different goods available.</b>

10:38.527 --> 10:39.957
<b>Over here too.</b>

10:39.957 --> 10:42.867
<b>The food at this stall isn't 
very good, so I wouldn't.</b>

10:46.087 --> 10:47.547
<b>Let's go!</b>

10:47.547 --> 10:48.967
<b>Perky boobies.</b>

10:49.247 --> 10:50.487
<b>Thank goodness.</b>

10:50.487 --> 10:52.157
<b>It looks like it's going well.</b>

10:52.987 --> 10:54.507
<b>King Takuto!</b>

10:54.867 --> 10:56.697
<b>Your hands aren't moving.</b>

10:57.767 --> 10:59.287
<b>Sorry, sorry.</b>

11:06.727 --> 11:08.447
<b>Farewell, then!</b>

11:10.677 --> 11:14.117
<b>Miss Antelise is a kind person.</b>

11:17.937 --> 11:20.887
<b>Now, let's review today's investigation.</b>

11:20.887 --> 11:23.287
<b>Big Sis, how did it seem to you?</b>

11:24.897 --> 11:25.957
<b>Anxious.</b>

11:26.667 --> 11:28.117
<b>"I have no food."</b>

11:28.117 --> 11:30.347
<b>"The enemies outside are scary."</b>

11:30.347 --> 11:32.447
<b>"No one's coming to save us."</b>

11:32.447 --> 11:34.847
<b>"What are we going to do?"</b>

11:34.847 --> 11:37.537
<b>That's awfully specific.</b>

11:37.537 --> 11:40.427
<b>Big Sis is sensitive to 
the emotions of others,</b>

11:40.427 --> 11:43.367
<b>so she can get a vague idea of how they feel.</b>

11:45.207 --> 11:48.587
<b>Oh! To have such a power!</b>

11:48.587 --> 11:49.647
<b>I see!</b>

11:49.647 --> 11:50.987
<b>So that's why she wanted this.</b>

11:52.507 --> 11:54.107
<b>What is that?</b>

11:54.107 --> 11:56.457
<b>Something my lady Maria 
asked me to buy for her</b>

11:56.457 --> 11:59.447
<b>while we were going through 
the city this afternoon.</b>

11:59.447 --> 12:01.117
<b>I got it in secret!</b>

12:02.387 --> 12:03.527
<b>Grass?</b>

12:03.527 --> 12:05.817
<b>Is this Popil Grass?</b>

12:05.817 --> 12:07.587
<b>It has its nuts too.</b>

12:07.937 --> 12:10.867
<b>You're familiar with this, Lady Caria?</b>

12:11.317 --> 12:14.817
<b>It's a plant that can cause powerful 
euphoria and hallucinations.</b>

12:14.817 --> 12:20.137
<b>Nearly every nation has banned its 
use, possession, and cultivation.</b>

12:20.137 --> 12:22.227
<b>Ah, a narcotic?</b>

12:22.227 --> 12:23.937
<b>That's no good, young lady.</b>

12:23.937 --> 12:25.677
<b>Go throw that away.</b>

12:25.677 --> 12:26.517
<b>Toss!</b>

12:27.087 --> 12:30.827
<b>It's in good shape and too free 
of bug holes to be a wild plant.</b>

12:30.827 --> 12:33.737
<b>It was probably grown by someone.</b>

12:33.737 --> 12:37.627
<b>And that's circulating 
the markets of Dragontan?</b>

12:37.627 --> 12:40.237
<b>That's dangerous business.</b>

12:40.647 --> 12:42.007
<b>Let's go!</b>

12:46.867 --> 12:49.887
<b>All when Miss Antelise 
is working so hard too...</b>

12:50.337 --> 12:52.787
<b>It sounds like we'll need to be cautious,</b>

12:52.787 --> 12:55.357
<b>even when we're sightseeing.</b>

12:55.357 --> 12:56.967
<b>Yes, Saburo.</b>

12:56.967 --> 12:59.827
<b>Make sure to protect the young ladies!</b>

12:59.827 --> 13:03.197
<b>I would like to avoid any conflicts...</b>

13:04.137 --> 13:07.767
<b>But humans love conflict.</b>

13:08.117 --> 13:10.967
<b>Wh-What?!</b>

13:22.087 --> 13:23.447
<b>It's cold.</b>

13:23.767 --> 13:27.127
<b>Young ladies, this is the Dragon Vein Mine.</b>

13:27.127 --> 13:29.357
<b>It has been cleverly concealed with the soil,</b>

13:29.357 --> 13:32.657
<b>but it seems they couldn't hide it all.</b>

13:34.987 --> 13:36.337
<b>It's pretty.</b>

13:37.047 --> 13:39.137
<b>Caria, Maria.</b>

13:39.687 --> 13:43.207
<b>This world is filled with lots 
of pretty things and places</b>

13:43.207 --> 13:45.267
<b>that you don't know about yet.</b>

13:58.057 --> 14:01.867
<b>The Popil Grass grows well in this place.</b>

14:01.867 --> 14:07.657
<b>Please forgive me for imposing,
emissaries of Mynoghra.</b>

14:07.657 --> 14:10.677
<b>I run a business here in the city.</b>

14:10.677 --> 14:13.337
<b>My name is Vesta Kurklain.</b>

14:13.337 --> 14:16.987
<b>Thank you for the introduction.</b>

14:16.987 --> 14:19.797
<b>So what did you wish to discuss with us?</b>

14:19.797 --> 14:24.717
<b>I'm a merchant, so of course, 
I'd like to discuss business.</b>

14:25.197 --> 14:29.637
<b>I've heard that this land will be 
jointly contrlled by your nation.</b>

14:29.637 --> 14:31.117
<b>So, how about it?</b>

14:31.117 --> 14:35.147
<b>Would you be willing to cultivate 
Popil Grass here with me?</b>

14:35.647 --> 14:38.127
<b>What's the benefit for Mynoghra?</b>

14:38.127 --> 14:41.447
<b>What should I report to our king?</b>

14:41.447 --> 14:44.037
<b>Popil Grass fetches a high price.</b>

14:44.037 --> 14:47.537
<b>You would be given a 
portion of those earnings.</b>

14:47.817 --> 14:51.827
<b>Of course, I'd prepare 
other offerings as well.</b>

14:52.297 --> 14:55.237
<b>Other offerings... like what?</b>

14:55.237 --> 14:58.587
<b>This isn't a good place 
to discuss that further.</b>

14:58.587 --> 15:02.827
<b>Please come to this location 
after sundown today.</b>

15:02.827 --> 15:05.097
<b>We'll go into details there.</b>

15:09.577 --> 15:13.557
<b>It's nice dealing with people 
who are evil-aligned.</b>

15:13.557 --> 15:16.057
<b>You're always quick to understand.</b>

15:16.057 --> 15:20.067
<b>The current mayor is so inflexible 
that it makes things difficult.</b>

15:20.547 --> 15:24.577
<b>I'm sure your king would be delighted as well.</b>

15:24.577 --> 15:27.567
<b>Now then, I'll be waiting for you.</b>

15:40.387 --> 15:43.337
<b>Time sure flew by, didn't it?</b>

15:43.337 --> 15:44.607
<b>Yes.</b>

15:44.607 --> 15:48.347
<b>You've really taken good 
care of us, Miss Antelise.</b>

15:48.347 --> 15:49.517
<b>Yeah, yeah!</b>

15:49.517 --> 15:51.047
<b>It's fine, it's fine.</b>

15:51.047 --> 15:53.227
<b>I got to network with you two, after all.</b>

15:53.597 --> 15:56.367
<b>We're not all that important,</b>

15:56.367 --> 15:59.117
<b>but I do hope you'll rely 
on us if you ever need anything.</b>

15:59.117 --> 16:01.947
<b>My, how reassuring to hear!</b>

16:01.947 --> 16:07.907
<b>In that case, please make sure you present 
me in the best light to Mynoghra's king!</b>

16:07.907 --> 16:09.687
<b>Of course!</b>

16:09.687 --> 16:11.327
<b>Exciting!</b>

16:12.457 --> 16:14.907
<b>Pardon me.</b>

16:16.207 --> 16:17.187
<b>Vesta?!</b>

16:17.187 --> 16:19.927
<b>Who gave you permission to be here?!</b>

16:18.817 --> 16:21.617
<b>Now, now, Mayor.</b>

16:21.617 --> 16:25.487
<b>I received permission from the staff. Right?</b>

16:28.177 --> 16:29.597
<b>Why you...</b>

16:32.187 --> 16:36.597
<b>Now then, young ladies, may I have 
your response to my previous offer?</b>

16:36.597 --> 16:37.677
<b>Huh?</b>

16:37.677 --> 16:41.227
<b>You mean the proposal to 
grow Popil Grass together?</b>

16:41.227 --> 16:44.847
<b>Yes. You never stopped by,</b>

16:44.847 --> 16:47.697
<b>so I came to hear your reply in person.</b>

16:49.197 --> 16:50.477
<b><i>You're kidding!</i></b>

16:50.477 --> 16:54.497
<b><i>These children made a deal 
with Vesta behind my back?!</i></b>

16:55.027 --> 16:58.097
<b><i>If the forces of darkness join 
hands with scum like him,</i></b>

16:58.097 --> 16:59.337
<b><i>then this city's finished...</i></b>

16:59.827 --> 17:01.527
<b>What's the matter?</b>

17:01.527 --> 17:02.317
<b>Huh?</b>

17:03.127 --> 17:06.357
<b>There's no way we would 
work with someone like you.</b>

17:06.357 --> 17:08.247
<b>I thought you would understand that</b>

17:08.247 --> 17:10.677
<b>when we didn't show up to respond.</b>

17:11.207 --> 17:14.427
<b>That's quite the protest.</b>

17:14.427 --> 17:16.317
<b>Miss Antelise,</b>

17:16.317 --> 17:19.247
<b>would it be an issue if 
we took care of these men?</b>

17:19.247 --> 17:22.407
<b>If I acted out of turn and caused 
a rift between our nations,</b>

17:22.407 --> 17:24.857
<b>I wouldn't be able to face our king.</b>

17:26.627 --> 17:29.097
<b>S-Sure! We wouldn't mind that!</b>

17:29.097 --> 17:30.737
<b>Have at them as you please!</b>

17:30.737 --> 17:34.467
<b>These guys have been 
making a mess of my city!</b>

17:34.467 --> 17:35.987
<b>Teach them a lesson!</b>

17:40.897 --> 17:43.337
<b>How unfortunate, young lady.</b>

17:43.337 --> 17:44.597
<b>What's that?</b>

17:44.597 --> 17:48.087
<b>It's probably a concentrate 
of Popil Grass extract.</b>

17:48.367 --> 17:53.097
<b>I bet a single injection of that will 
make a person unable to live without it.</b>

17:53.367 --> 17:54.527
<b>What?!</b>

17:54.527 --> 17:56.417
<b>Do you understand what you're doing?</b>

17:56.417 --> 17:58.597
<b>If you try to lay a hand on us,</b>

17:58.597 --> 18:01.607
<b>then you'll be making an 
enemy out of Mynoghra.</b>

18:01.607 --> 18:04.477
<b>Do you understand how foolish that is?</b>

18:04.477 --> 18:06.487
<b>We may be powerless children,</b>

18:06.487 --> 18:11.197
<b>but King Ira Takuto, the man who ordered 
us on this mission, is an incredible king.</b>

18:11.197 --> 18:13.657
<b>I'll be fine.</b>

18:13.657 --> 18:15.617
<b>One injection of this</b>

18:15.617 --> 18:18.097
<b>and you ladies will follow my commands.</b>

18:18.097 --> 18:19.147
<b>After that,</b>

18:19.147 --> 18:22.687
<b>I'm sure this perverted 
pedophile, Ira Takuto,</b>

18:22.687 --> 18:25.697
<b>will do as I say without complaint.</b>

18:36.917 --> 18:37.477
<b>Huh?!</b>

18:39.767 --> 18:44.337
<b>I never thought that unit would 
prove so useful in this world.</b>

18:47.327 --> 18:49.757
<b>Yes, that's so true.</b>

18:49.757 --> 18:52.177
<b>Um, may I ask a question?</b>

18:53.127 --> 18:55.667
<b>Why did you send the Medics as their guards?</b>

18:55.667 --> 18:58.287
<b>You could have sent our Warriors, right?</b>

18:58.587 --> 19:03.497
<b>They absolutely love humans, including 
closely related demi-humans.</b>

19:04.497 --> 19:05.377
<b>Sorry?</b>

19:05.767 --> 19:10.877
<b>Because of that, they have some 
rather unique abilities as a unit.</b>

19:10.877 --> 19:16.757
m 0 0 l 250 0 250 118 0 118

19:10.877 --> 19:16.757
m 0 0 l 150 0 150 2 0 2

19:10.877 --> 19:16.757
<b>Brain Eater</b>

19:10.877 --> 19:16.757
<b>Medic Unit</b>

19:10.877 --> 19:16.757
<b>Strength: 3 Movement: 1
</b>

19:10.877 --> 19:16.757
<b>Attack Bonus Vs. Humans +50%
 Recovery Bonus Vs. Humans +50%
 Happiness Bonus to
 Human Governed Cities +50%</b>

19:10.877 --> 19:16.757
<b>Description</b>

19:10.877 --> 19:16.757
Brain Eaters are an alternative unit (for Medic units)
belonging to the evil civilization of Mynoghra. Their basic
 function is the ability to heal all allied units in the same
 stack every turn. Furthermore, their intense passion for
 humans grants them powerful bonuses towards humans 
and closely related demi-humans. However, since 
Mynoghra does not have any humans, unique strategies 
are required to make good use of them, which
 generally proves difficult.

19:11.767 --> 19:13.437
<b>They excel...</b>

19:13.437 --> 19:16.757
<b>Both at healing humans and killing them.</b>

19:17.807 --> 19:21.767
<b>They love humans, but couldn't 
quite become humans themselves.</b>

19:21.767 --> 19:24.857
<b>That's what our Brain Eaters are.</b>

19:31.957 --> 19:34.357
<b>How magnificent, Saburo!</b>

19:34.357 --> 19:37.857
<b>Yes! Such foolish adherence 
to their own selfish desires!</b>

19:37.857 --> 19:39.487
<b>How truly human!</b>

19:39.487 --> 19:42.357
<b>This means that if we peel off their 
skin and wear it ourselves, then...!</b>

19:42.357 --> 19:46.087
<b>We'll become even closer 
to being true humans!</b>

19:46.437 --> 19:49.057
<b>Wh-What are you people?!</b>

19:49.057 --> 19:51.047
<b>Humans!</b>

19:54.277 --> 19:55.557
<b>There, there.</b>

19:55.557 --> 19:57.507
<b>Don't be afraid.</b>

19:58.357 --> 20:00.727
<b>Please get him already.</b>

20:00.727 --> 20:02.507
<b>H-Hold on!</b>

20:02.507 --> 20:04.847
<b>You're all crooks like me, aren't you?!</b>

20:05.177 --> 20:07.417
<b>Please don't group us together.</b>

20:07.417 --> 20:10.137
<b>You have insulted our king.</b>

20:10.137 --> 20:12.857
<b>That is the most unforgivable 
thing you could've done.</b>

20:13.207 --> 20:15.377
<b>Wh-What?</b>

20:13.207 --> 20:16.607
<b>I will not show mercy to Mynoghra's enemies.</b>

20:16.607 --> 20:19.977
<b>I will not show mercy to 
anyone who harms my big sis.</b>

20:19.977 --> 20:24.707
<b>And I will never show mercy to 
anyone who insults our king.</b>

20:24.707 --> 20:29.217
<b>Our king taught us this: Evil 
people are free to do anything.</b>

20:29.217 --> 20:34.407
<b>So with that freedom and approval 
of our king, I command you—</b>

20:34.407 --> 20:36.917
<b>S-Stop!</b>

20:36.917 --> 20:38.427
<b>Please kill him!</b>

20:38.427 --> 20:39.717
<b>Kill him!</b>

20:39.717 --> 20:41.217
<b>As you command!</b>

20:50.817 --> 20:53.367
<b>What do you think, young ladies?</b>

20:53.367 --> 20:54.167
<b>So human!</b>

20:54.167 --> 20:55.927
<b>Human!</b>

20:57.367 --> 20:59.357
<b>Miss Antelise...</b>

20:59.357 --> 21:01.867
<b>Um, I'm sorry.</b>

21:02.477 --> 21:04.697
<b>For making such a mess of your room.</b>

21:04.697 --> 21:05.407
<b>Huh?</b>

21:05.407 --> 21:07.247
<b>They got carried away.</b>

21:07.247 --> 21:11.897
<b>We never thought those 
birdbrains would go this far.</b>

21:11.897 --> 21:17.677
<b>What would you like us to do about the 
cleaning bill or the cost of new clothes?</b>

21:17.677 --> 21:20.807
<b>Th-That's... not an issue.</b>

21:20.807 --> 21:21.807
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

21:22.137 --> 21:26.537
<b>Thank you so much, Miss Antelise!</b>

21:27.607 --> 21:29.517
<b><i>Oh, this girl...</i></b>

21:30.167 --> 21:33.987
<b><i>doesn't think anything 
of this gruesome scene.</i></b>

21:36.877 --> 21:37.677
<b>Oh my?!</b>

21:37.677 --> 21:40.497
<b>The mayor has wet herself!</b>

21:40.497 --> 21:43.847
<b>Heavens! We need to show 
her human thoughtfulness!</b>

21:43.847 --> 21:46.427
<b>In which case, let us pee ourselves too!</b>

21:46.427 --> 21:49.257
<b>We mustn't allow the mayor 
to bear such shame alone!</b>

21:49.257 --> 21:50.337
<b>Peeing!</b>

21:50.337 --> 21:55.287
<b>Cut it out already, you birdbrains!</b>

21:55.287 --> 21:56.757
<b>Human!</b>

21:56.757 --> 21:57.927
<b>You can't go doing that!</b>

21:57.927 --> 22:01.297
<b>Are you trying to shame Miss Antelise 
even further, you birdbrains?!</b>

21:59.757 --> 22:01.297
<b>That's right!</b>

22:01.297 --> 22:03.657
<b>You birdbrains are oddballs to the core!</b>

22:02.257 --> 22:03.657
<b>Human!</b>

22:03.657 --> 22:04.757
<b>But...</b>

22:06.887 --> 22:08.827
<b>Messed up.</b>
